      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-panorra-2917",
      "display_title": "Issue #2917: [Profile Setting] Integrate API Update Social Links",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">DEMO BY DEVELOPER</h2>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">social_link.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"videos/video-cb564e0e-4111-41b3-90a2-c2b0c1e82a1b.mp4\" data-canonical-src=\"videos/video-cb564e0e-4111-41b3-90a2-c2b0c1e82a1b.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5076987857\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-new/issues/424\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-new/issues/424/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-new/issues/424\">GoThruMedia/panorra-api-new#424</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Route</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-httpspec notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"PUT /v2/users/me/social\nAuthorization: &lt;JWT token&gt;\nContent-Type: application/json\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">PUT</span><span class=\"pl-c1\"> /v2/users/me/social</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-v\">Authorization:</span> &lt;JWT token&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-v\">Content-Type:</span> application/json</span></pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Payload</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;links&quot;: [\n    {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;instagram&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;instagram.com/raka&quot;},\n    {&quot;url&quot;: &quot;youtube.com/@raka&quot;},\n    {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;unknown&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;portfolio.example.com&quot;}\n  ]\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"links\"</span>: [\n    {<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>instagram<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"url\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>instagram.com/raka<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>},\n    {<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"url\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>youtube.com/@raka<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>},\n    {<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>unknown<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"url\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>portfolio.example.com<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>}\n  ]\n}</pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Behavior</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Replaces full list inside one database transaction.</li>\n<li>Empty array deletes all links.</li>\n<li>Maximum 10; duplicate link types allowed.</li>\n<li>Array order becomes position 1-10.</li>\n<li>URLs normalize to HTTPS; maximum 2048 characters.</li>\n<li>Recognized optional <code class=\"notranslate\">type</code> is used directly.</li>\n<li>Unknown or absent <code class=\"notranslate\">type</code> triggers domain detection.</li>\n<li>Unknown domains default to <code class=\"notranslate\">website</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Supported platforms: Instagram, Facebook, X/Twitter, LinkedIn, TikTok, YouTube.<br>\nResolved value is persisted in <code class=\"notranslate\">user_social_links.type</code>; unknown domains use <code class=\"notranslate\">website</code>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Success</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{&quot;statusCode&quot;:200,&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;valid&quot;:true,&quot;messages&quot;:&quot;Success update social links&quot;}}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"statusCode\"</span>:<span class=\"pl-c1\">200</span>,<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"data\"</span>:{<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"valid\"</span>:<span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>,<span class=\"pl-ent\">\"messages\"</span>:<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Success update social links<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>}}</pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Errors</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">400</code>: invalid JSON.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">401</code>: invalid auth or role.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">409</code>: user missing.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">422</code>: more than 10 links or invalid URL.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">500</code>: transaction failure.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Endpoint</h2>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">PUT /v2/users/me/social</code></h2>",
