      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-panorra-2889",
      "display_title": "Issue #2889: Implement Update Profile New Layout",
      "main_description_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Based on result from task UI: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4924601492\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra/issues/2841\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/panorra/issues/2841/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra/issues/2841\">#2841</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">DEMO BY DEVELOPER</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-1693f793-d7af-4360-b75d-44efda74d7dc.png\"><img width=\"585\" height=\"1266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-1693f793-d7af-4360-b75d-44efda74d7dc.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1266px;; aspect-ratio: 585 / 1266; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>",
