    {
      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-panorra-2860",
      "display_title": "Issue #2860: [Discover] Integrate API Search Hashtag",
      "main_description_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Integrate the updated <strong>Search Hashtag</strong> API on Discover. BE task: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4801123477\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/452\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/452/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/452\">GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go#452</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Existing endpoint, updated contract</strong> - <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /search/hashtag</code></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">What is new (FE-facing)</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Each hashtag item now returns:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">posts[]</code> - up to <strong>4</strong> recent public posts, each <code class=\"notranslate\">{ slug, thumbnail }</code> (empty array if none)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Existing fields unchanged: <code class=\"notranslate\">tag</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">count</code> (total posts), <code class=\"notranslate\">counter</code>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Scope</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> extend the typed DTO: <code class=\"notranslate\">posts: { slug, thumbnail }[]</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> render the hashtag row with <code class=\"notranslate\">tag</code>, count, and up to 4 thumbnails</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> tap a thumbnail -&gt; Post Detail (use <code class=\"notranslate\">slug</code>); tap the row -&gt; Hashtag Detail</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> handle empty <code class=\"notranslate\">posts[]</code>; loading / empty / error states</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Testing Scenario (for tester)</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Discover -&gt; search hashtags -&gt; each result shows the tag, count, and up to 4 thumbnails.</li>\n<li>Tap a thumbnail -&gt; correct post opens; tap the tag -&gt; Hashtag Detail opens.</li>\n<li>Hashtag with no posts -&gt; row renders without thumbnails.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">DEMO BY DEVELOPER</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-81de72c7-e247-4e86-aa2f-adfe8d392b40.png\"><img width=\"585\" height=\"1266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-81de72c7-e247-4e86-aa2f-adfe8d392b40.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1266px;; aspect-ratio: 585 / 1266; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>",
      "metadata": {
        "number": 2860,
        "author": "anurdin01",
        "updated_at": "2026-08-07T07:57:11Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-panorra-2859",
      "display_title": "Issue #2859: [Discover] Integrate API Search User",
      "main_description_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Integrate the updated <strong>Search User</strong> API on Discover. BE task: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4801122458\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/451\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/451/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/451\">GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go#451</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Existing endpoint, updated contract</strong> - <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /search/user</code></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">What is new (FE-facing)</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Each user item now returns:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">total_post</code> (int)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">total_follower</code> (int)</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">posts[]</code> - up to <strong>4</strong> recent public posts, each <code class=\"notranslate\">{ slug, thumbnail }</code> (empty array if none)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Existing fields (<code class=\"notranslate\">fullname</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">username</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">avatar</code>) unchanged. Results ordered by follower count DESC.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Scope</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> extend the typed DTO: <code class=\"notranslate\">total_post</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">total_follower</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">posts: { slug, thumbnail }[]</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> render the user row with counts + up to 4 post thumbnails (Discover User section)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> tap a thumbnail -&gt; Post Detail (use <code class=\"notranslate\">slug</code>); tap the row -&gt; profile</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> handle empty <code class=\"notranslate\">posts[]</code>; loading / empty / error states</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Testing Scenario (for tester)</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Discover -&gt; search users -&gt; each result shows counts and up to 4 thumbnails.</li>\n<li>Tap a thumbnail -&gt; correct post opens; tap the user -&gt; profile opens.</li>\n<li>User with no posts -&gt; row renders without thumbnails (no broken layout).</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">DEMO BY DEVELOPER</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-485875f4-9f93-45fe-8efa-19cb50b8cb97.png\"><img width=\"585\" height=\"1266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-485875f4-9f93-45fe-8efa-19cb50b8cb97.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1266px;; aspect-ratio: 585 / 1266; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>",
      "metadata": {
        "number": 2859,
        "author": "anurdin01",
        "updated_at": "2026-08-07T07:57:34Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-panorra-2858",
      "display_title": "Issue #2858: [Discover] Integrate API Search Post",
      "main_description_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Integrate the updated <strong>Search Post</strong> API on Discover. BE task: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4826610757\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/457\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/457/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go/issues/457\">GoThruMedia/panorra-api-go#457</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Existing endpoint, updated contract</strong> - <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /search/post</code></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">What is new (FE-facing)</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong><code class=\"notranslate\">include</code> query param</strong> - comma-separated whitelist to trim the payload. Fields not listed are stripped from the response (<code class=\"notranslate\">slug</code> is always returned).<br>\nAllowed: <code class=\"notranslate\">slug, thumbnail, panorama_preview, panorama_quality, post_type, animation, animation_filter, little_planet, little_planet_filter, pending, potd, fullname, username, avatar, broadcast_data, location_name, location_post, description</code></li>\n<li><strong>Description formatting</strong> - response now also returns <code class=\"notranslate\">short_description</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">long_description</code> (derived from <code class=\"notranslate\">description</code>).</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Scope</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> add <code class=\"notranslate\">include</code> support to the search-post call (request only the fields the UI needs)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> extend the typed DTO with <code class=\"notranslate\">short_description</code> / <code class=\"notranslate\">long_description</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> render short/long description per the design</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> loading / empty / error states</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Testing Scenario (for tester)</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Discover -&gt; search posts -&gt; results render.</li>\n<li>With <code class=\"notranslate\">include</code> set, only the requested fields come back (smaller payload), UI still correct.</li>\n<li>Posts with long descriptions show short/long variants correctly.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">DEMO BY DEVELOPER</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-c26a9af5-0fcf-4ad4-bc3f-ff39d7728039.png\"><img width=\"585\" height=\"1266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-c26a9af5-0fcf-4ad4-bc3f-ff39d7728039.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1266px;; aspect-ratio: 585 / 1266; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>",
      "metadata": {
        "number": 2858,
        "author": "anurdin01",
        "updated_at": "2026-08-07T07:58:24Z"
      }
    },
